docs {
  # Get project

  Authentication: authenticated session cookie; requires any organization membership.
  Expected response: `200` with `project`.
  Error cases: `401` `UNAUTHENTICATED`; `403` `FORBIDDEN`; `404` `PROJECT_NOT_FOUND`.
}
